OL,3,GNEWSAPetition triggers debate on future
OL,4,Aof leisure centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 2,700 people have signed a
OL,7,Fpetition opposing plans to close a
OL,8,FLeicester leisure centre, triggering a
OL,9,Fcouncil debate.
OL,11,FThe petition was launched in response
OL,12,Fto proposals to shut New Parks Leisure
OL,13,FCentre, something organisers previously
OL,14,Fsaid would "leave a significant void in
OL,15,Four community".
OL,17,FA six-week consultation on the plans,
OL,18,Fthat could see the centre in St
OL,19,FOswald's Road close while facilities at
OL,20,FLeicester Leys Leisure Centre in
OL,21,FBeaumont Leys are expanded, ended on 3
OL,22,FNovember.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
