OL,3,GNEWSAPetition triggers debate on future
OL,4,Aof leisure centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Leicester City
OL,7,FCouncil said the petition had received
OL,8,Fmore than 1,500 verified signatures and
OL,9,Fwould be presented at a full council
OL,10,Fmeeting on Thursday.
